# Project Conventions

- Use named exports only.
- Do not create barrel files or re-export modules (e.g. `export { X } from "..."`).
- Prefer direct imports from concrete file paths.
- Use functional React components and hooks only.
- Keep TypeScript strict and explicit.
- Write all user-facing text and assistant output in English.

# Framework Exception

- Next.js route files may require a default export (`app/page.tsx`, `app/layout.tsx`).
- In those files, define a named function and keep the framework-required default export as a thin alias only.
